From: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:25:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 22/94] dt-bindings: CPRh and OSM for SDM630/SDM660

- power/avs/qcom,cprh.yaml: the CPRh controller of MSM8998 and
  SDM630/660, with the fuse cells the cpr3 driver reads. Based on
  AngeloGioacchino Del Regno's qcom,cpr3.yaml with Konrad Dybcio's
  changes ("dt-bindings: soc: qcom: cpr3: Add bindings for CPR3+
  driver", v15).
- opp/opp-v2-qcom-level.yaml: qcom,opp-oloop-vadj and
  qcom,opp-cloop-vadj, as in Konrad Dybcio's "dt-bindings: opp:
  v2-qcom-level: Document CPR3 open/closed loop volt adjustment" (v15).
- opp/opp-v2-qcom-osm.yaml: the OSM OPP properties (qcom,pll-override,
  qcom,spare-data, qcom,pll-div) the qcom-cpufreq-hw OSM code reads.
- cpufreq/cpufreq-qcom-hw.yaml: qcom,sdm660-cpufreq-hw with its
  osm-domainN/freq-domainN regions.

